Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20Cloud=20Feeds=20(patch=200041)=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20rss-gateway=20profile=20subscriptions?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

FragmentDialogCloudFeeds: fetches /feed/profiles.json from the rss-gateway
sidecar, shows a checkbox list of profile groups (security/cicd/health/ops/
all), and creates one RSS folder per selected profile — one URL per group
instead of N individual topic subscriptions.

Token stored in SharedPreferences (comms_cloud_token). WorkerFeedSync injects
Authorization: Bearer <token> on all feed_url polls matching /feed/ path.
FragmentSetup menu entry 'Cloud feeds…' → ACTION_ADD_CLOUD_FEEDS action.
CommsAccounts.createCloudProfileFeed() delegates to createRssFeed().
